  "description": "The app-side half of Appium.Harness for .NET MAUI: TestProbe publishes chosen view\n      properties — a colour, a bound view-model value — into the platform accessibility tree, so\n      an Appium test can assert on them with Appium.Harness's HasTextColor and HasProperty. Off\n      unless the app opts in with UseTestProbes(), so a shipping build publishes nothing.",
